:INFO
Art. 6 Review of the application
1 The FOPH shall review whether:
a. the documents are complete;
b. the licensing conditions specified in the StRA are met.
2 It may request additional documents from the project leader.
|

:INFO
Art. 7 Period
1 The FOPH shall reach a decision within 60 days.
2 If the FOPH requests additional documents from the project leader, the period shall begin as soon as the documents have arrived.
3 The FOPH shall notify the project leader of the beginning of the period.
|

